message: "If you use jspassgen-cli in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "jspassgen-cli: the command line of the jspassgen password generator suite"
abstract: >-
  A Node.js command line that generates strong passwords on the user's
  machine from the platform CSPRNG, with all generation done by the
  @sebastienrousseau/jspassgen library.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
